<title>UK: Credit Local sets 400 million DKK March 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 400 million DKK March 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg SA and ABN Amro.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    06.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 YTM	   5.10</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA1   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
